<B>Parameters of this class are:</B><BR><BR>
<table class="doxtable" border="1" width="100%" cellpadding="4">
<tr><th>Name</th><th>Type</th><th>Default</th><th>Restrictions</th><th>Description</th></tr>
<tr>
  <td style="vertical-align:top"><b>non_shuffle_pattern</b></td>
  <td style="vertical-align:top">string</td><td style="vertical-align:top">KRP</td>
  <td style="vertical-align:top">&nbsp;</td><td style="vertical-align:top">Residues to not shuffle (keep at a constant position when shuffling). Default is 'KPR' to not shuffle lysine, arginine and proline.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
  <td style="vertical-align:top"><i>keepPeptideNTerm</i></td>
  <td style="vertical-align:top">string</td><td style="vertical-align:top">true</td>
  <td style="vertical-align:top">true, false</td><td style="vertical-align:top">Whether to keep peptide N terminus constant when shuffling / reversing.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
  <td style="vertical-align:top"><i>keepPeptideCTerm</i></td>
  <td style="vertical-align:top">string</td><td style="vertical-align:top">true</td>
  <td style="vertical-align:top">true, false</td><td style="vertical-align:top">Whether to keep peptide C terminus constant when shuffling / reversing.</td>
</tr>
</table>
<br>
